   "subject": "Re: Issue changing Shiny's web root from \"/\" to \"/shiny\"",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\">Figured it out... not a Shiny issue, but a Nginx issue.</font><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><p style=\"line-height:1.42857em;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">The issue was with Nginx, not Shiny server.  Here&#39;s where I found the solution: <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-server/issues/118\" style=\"color:rgb(0,121,211)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-server/issues/118&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390131086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2J_cVjPHpP3noNkVDiIVxI\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-server/issues/118</a></font></p><p style=\"line-height:1.42857em;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height:1.42857em;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">I hope this helps someone.  It was a really annoying troubleshooting exercise.  The main takeaway is that when you&#39;re debugging anything web-based: <b><font size=\"4\">don&#39;t forget to open the javascript debugger in your browser.  It will tell you a lot.</font></b></p><p style=\"line-height:1.42857em;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><b><font size=\"4\"><br></font></b></p><p style=\"line-height:1.42857em;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">Thanks,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:1.42857em;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"line-height:1.42857em;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">Mark</font></p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Monday, April 24, 2017 at 11:24:03 AM UTC-4, Mark Shervey wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">The sample Shiny apps run fine from /, but when I changed the .conf file to serve from /shiny, I run into issues.  We already serve something from &quot;/&quot; and it can&#39;t be changed.  We have a Flask app and a Shiny app being reverse proxied by an Nginx server.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">When serving from &quot;/&quot; the test page comes up fine and the examples load perfectly.  Changing the .conf file to serve from &quot;/shiny&quot; breaks the examples: the R sample shows a slider with number of bins, but when I move it, there is a gray overlay that disables the app. The rmarkdown version just gets a status spinner and a gray overlay.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">I&#39;m hoping a small nudge in the right direction will fix this. I&#39;m not familiar with Shiny in the least, and am having a tough time even figuring out which terms to search for on Google.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">Thanks,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">Mark</span><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EXRm_7-3RCA/WP4YczJLb5I/AAAAAAAAEFU/GTILZZAnRDAMgQ-AXCiTZ4lfVJDtRwRRwCLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-04-24%2Bat%2B11.23.03%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EXRm_7-3RCA/WP4YczJLb5I/AAAAAAAAEFU/GTILZZAnRDAMgQ-AXCiTZ4lfVJDtRwRRwCLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2017-04-24%252Bat%252B11.23.03%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390131087000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nOc6iQ4TsHqK3fiJLYOUr\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EXRm_7-3RCA/WP4YczJLb5I/AAAAAAAAEFU/GTILZZAnRDAMgQ-AXCiTZ4lfVJDtRwRRwCLcB/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-04-24%2Bat%2B11.23.03%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"100\" height=\"320\"></a></p><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
